INT. WAYNE MANOR - STUDY - NIGHT

The grand study of Wayne Manor is filled with the warm glow of a crackling fireplace. ANDREA enters, looking around at the opulent surroundings. ALFRED, the ever-dutiful butler, stands by the window, gazing out into the night.

ANDREA
Good evening, Alfred. I was hoping you might have some advice for me.

ALFRED
(turning to Andrea with a polite smile)
Ah, Master Andrea. While I would be delighted to assist, I'm afraid Master Wayne has asked me to reserve my counsel for those he trusts implicitly.

Andrea nods, understanding the importance of trust in this line of work.

ANDREA
I understand, Alfred. I'll continue to earn that trust.

ALFRED
Of course, sir. Gotham needs all the help it can get.

Andrea takes a moment to appreciate the wisdom in Alfred's words before heading back out into the night.

===GAME END===

